// ---- off: the Zs ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// The three Zs are one outline each, a step of (684, 344) apart (bottom-left to top-right). Over the clock every Z moves one step
// along that line (`drift`, eased in and out); the top one leaves and fades, a new one grows in where the bottom one was. Each bobs
// `bob` units on its own phase (`lag` apart: a wave runs up the three), `bobs` times over the clock, eased in and out.
var ZZZ = { step: [684, 344], bob: 95, bobs: 1.5, lag: 0.95, inUntil: 0.7, outFrom: 0.3, growFrom: 0.45, shrinkTo: 0.8 };
